Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:40:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Studio preview: catalogue plates on mixed ethnicities come
 from the API bake

The plate worker no longer blends a catalogue outfit for a mixed ethnicity in the browser:
it fetches /api/studio/avatar-set-clothes/fitted, a proxy of the API's fitted-plate route,
which runs the same bake a character save runs (the neck fit), so the preview is the saved
picture. New outfits, costumes, European/African and the white tee are made here as before.
RACE_INPUT_VERSION goes to avatar-set-maker-3 so plates cached by the browser are not reused.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
